    Notes:
    - Uid: 765511
      Name: Summary
      Text: 'This is an advanced example of <color=#FFEE22><b>General Damage Graph</b></color>,
        you can use it for any where a direct damage needs to be applied. This Graph
        is using in the demo scene.

        Feel free to modify it based on your
        game design.


        Damage Formulas:

        <color=#FFCC22>Dmg = (100
        * Atk)/(Def + 100)</color>


        Set ''<color=#22EEFF>FixedAtk</color>''
        and ''<color=#22EEFF>FixedCrit</color>'' Dynamic Variable value if there
        is no entity as damage dealer.

        Set ''<color=#22EEFF>TargetOTE</color>''
        as the index number of an <color=#FFCC22>Over Time Effect</color> for apply
        it to the Target upon hit.

        Set ''<color=#22EEFF>DealerOTE</color>''
        as the index number of an <color=#FFCC22>Over Time Effect</color> for apply
        it to the damage Dealer upon hit.

        Leave <color=#FFCC22>-1</color>
        for both of them if you don''t want to apply any effect upon hit.


        Set
        <color=#22EEFF>''dmgMulti''</color> as <color=#FFCC22>multiplier of the final
        damage</color>, you can bind this value with different skills, combo attacks,
        make them have their own damage multiplier value.


        Other calcultions
        included:<color=#FFCC22>

        - Energy Shield

        - Critical Damage

        -
        Reflect Damage

        - Instant kill Rate

        - Shield Blocking

        -
        Invincible

        - Stun

        - Backstab

        - Health Steal

        </color>'
      Position: {x: -818.2857, y: -1564}
      Size: {x: 1168.5714, y: 924.57135}
      FontSize: 1
      Theme: 1
    - Uid: 3849275
      Name: When Dealer is null
      Text: Some times the dealer is some none-entity object like lava, for such
        case we will give up tag comparison.
      Position: {x: -1360.5714, y: -637.1428}
      Size: {x: 426.2857, y: 207.99997}
      FontSize: 1
      Theme: 0
    - Uid: 33890208
      Name: 
      Text: "When dealer is null,\nWe will use the \"FixedAtk\" Dynamic variable
        on the <CombatDamage> inspector \nto set the attack power value."
      Position: {x: -2882.8572, y: 71.42857}
      Size: {x: 381.14282, y: 171.42856}
      FontSize: 1
      Theme: 0
    - Uid: 71650702
      Name: 
      Text: "When dealer is null,\nWe will use the \"FixedCrit\" Dynamic variable
        on the <CombatDamage> inspector \nto set the critical chance value."
      Position: {x: -3501.7144, y: 784.5714}
      Size: {x: 373.14282, y: 172}
      FontSize: 1
      Theme: 0
    - Uid: 246978
      Name: Damage formulas
      Text: 'We used basic damage formulas:

        Dmg = (100 * Atk)/(Def + 100)
        so attacks always do at least some damage.'
      Position: {x: -1548.5714, y: -216}
      Size: {x: 645.7143, y: 156}
      FontSize: 1
      Theme: 0
    - Uid: 87016488
      Name: 
      Text: If the target is invincible, The damage will be 0.
      Position: {x: -2153.7144, y: 697.1429}
      Size: {x: 300.00012, y: 100}
      FontSize: 1
      Theme: 0
    - Uid: 59062753
      Name: 
      Text: Randomly instant kill target base on Dealer's 'death' rate.
      Position: {x: -1509.7142, y: 128.57143}
      Size: {x: 344.5714, y: 116}
      FontSize: 1
      Theme: 0
    - Uid: 13955411
      Name: 
      Text: Only apply damage when the final damage value is greater or equal than
        0, to avoid unexpected bug.
      Position: {x: -861.1429, y: 169.14285}
      Size: {x: 297.7143, y: 193.71428}
      FontSize: 1
      Theme: 0
    - Uid: 24382353
      Name: 
      Text: If Dealer is not null and the Target has 'Reflect Damage' rate greater
        than 0, then reflect the final damage to the Dealer based on the 'Reflect
        Damage' rate.
      Position: {x: 1387.4286, y: -1100.5715}
      Size: {x: 542.8572, y: 185.14288}
      FontSize: 1
      Theme: 0
    - Uid: 35373417
      Name: Reduce HP
      Text: Reduce the Target's HP based on the final damage value.
      Position: {x: 1660.5714, y: 344}
      Size: {x: 300.5714, y: 210.85718}
      FontSize: 1
      Theme: 0
    - Uid: 85634938
      Name: 
      Text: 'If the target is blocking,

        Compare the angle between its forward
        direction and the vector between the Dealer and Target with the ''block''
        attribute(Degrees).'
      Position: {x: -2155.4285, y: 1201.1428}
      Size: {x: 312.5713, y: 262.85718}
      FontSize: 1
      Theme: 0
    - Uid: 159811
      Name: Final Damage
      Text: 
      Position: {x: -1188, y: 1529.1428}
      Size: {x: 281.7143, y: 100}
      FontSize: 1
      Theme: 0
    - Uid: 31387483
      Name: Event
      Text: 'Send "Damage" Event with the final damage value, Dealer Entity and Critical
        bool as args.

        Checking CharacterControl.cs and HealthBarUi.cs in
        the demo for how rigister and handle events.'
      Position: {x: 1661.7142, y: 808.5714}
      Size: {x: 337.71436, y: 344.57147}
      FontSize: 1
      Theme: 0
    - Uid: 3288832
      Name: Over Time Effect <Target>
      Text: If you set Dynamic Variable 'TargetOTE' on <CombatDamage> to any index
        number of an effect (other than -1), this over time effect will be add to
        the Target upon hit. Based on the resistance attribute of the Target, OTE
        could be randomly immune.
      Position: {x: 1353.1428, y: 1476}
      Size: {x: 549.14294, y: 274.85706}
      FontSize: 1
      Theme: 0
    - Uid: 13413667
      Name: Over Time Effect <Dealer>
      Text: If you set Dynamic Variable 'DealerOTE' on <CombatDamage> to any index
        number of an effect (other than -1), this over time effect will be add to
        the Dealer upon hit.
      Position: {x: 1357.7142, y: 1900}
      Size: {x: 550.28577, y: 314.28577}
      FontSize: 1
      Theme: 0
    - Uid: 67464473
      Name: Stun
      Text: Randomly stun the Target based on the stun chance of the damage Dealer.
      Position: {x: 1631.4286, y: 2388.5715}
      Size: {x: 311.4286, y: 256.5713}
      FontSize: 1
      Theme: 0
    - Uid: 5541127
      Name: Reduce Shield
      Text: Reduce the Target's Energy Shield Point when it's greater than 0, based
        on the final damage value.
      Position: {x: 1658.8572, y: -64.57143}
      Size: {x: 310.85706, y: 237.7143}
      FontSize: 1
      Theme: 0
    - Uid: 3505234
      Name: Health Steal
      Text: 'Add health point for damage Dealer based on its hp steal attribute and
        the final damage.

        And send Event to damage dealer for heal value.'
      Position: {x: 1358.2858, y: 2903.4287}
      Size: {x: 380, y: 234.28564}
      FontSize: 1
      Theme: 0
    - Uid: 33241364
      Name: Shield Block
      Text: Send message to the Target if it block the attack with shield, so it
        can play associated animation and sound.
      Position: {x: 1373.7142, y: 3489.7144}
      Size: {x: 396, y: 288}
      FontSize: 1
      Theme: 0
    - Uid: 6835261
      Name: 
      Text: Damage multiplier, this Dynamic Variable can be bind to skills, combos,make
        each action has their own damage multiplier.
      Position: {x: -1530.8572, y: 1237.1428}
      Size: {x: 329.14294, y: 202.85718}
      FontSize: 1
      Theme: 0
    - Uid: 11225784
      Name: 
      Text: 'The Resistance attribute of the Target. This value will decrease the
        chance of Target getting negative state, eg: Stun, Instant kill'
      Position: {x: -2756, y: -1046.2858}
      Size: {x: 524, y: 138.85712}
      FontSize: 1
      Theme: 0
    - Uid: 43898008
      Name: 
      Text: 'When attacking the target

        from back will guarantee the critical
        damage.'
      Position: {x: -3160.5715, y: 1068}
      Size: {x: 328.57153, y: 143.42847}
      FontSize: 1
      Theme: 0
