        Notes:
        - Uid: 765511
          Name: Summary
          Text: 'This is an advanced example of <color=#FFEE22><b>General Damage
            Graph</b></color>, you can use it for any where a direct damage needs
            to be applied. This Graph is using in the demo scene.

            Feel
            free to modify it based on your game design.


            Damage Formulas:

            <color=#FFCC22>Dmg
            = (100 * Atk)/(Def + 100)</color>


            Set ''<color=#22EEFF>FixedAtk</color>''
            and ''<color=#22EEFF>FixedCrit</color>'' Dynamic Variable value if there
            is no entity as damage dealer.

            Set ''<color=#22EEFF>TargetOTE</color>''
            as the index number of an <color=#FFCC22>Over Time Effect</color> for
            apply it to the Target upon hit.

            Set ''<color=#22EEFF>DealerOTE</color>''
            as the index number of an <color=#FFCC22>Over Time Effect</color> for
            apply it to the damage Dealer upon hit.

            Leave <color=#FFCC22>-1</color>
            for both of them if you don''t want to apply any effect upon hit.


            Set
            <color=#22EEFF>''dmgMulti''</color> as <color=#FFCC22>multiplier of the
            final damage</color>, you can bind this value with different skills,
            combo attacks, make them have their own damage multiplier value.


            Other
            calcultions included:<color=#FFCC22>

            - Energy Shield

            -
            Critical Damage

            - Reflect Damage

            - Instant
            kill Rate

            - Shield Blocking

            - Invincible

            -
            Stun

            - Health Steal

            </color>'
          Position: {x: -818.2857, y: -1564}
          Size: {x: 1168.5714, y: 830.28564}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 1
        - Uid: 3849275
          Name: When Dealer is null
          Text: Some times the dealer is some none-entity object like lava, for such
            case we will give up tag comparison.
          Position: {x: -1361.7142, y: -636}
          Size: {x: 426.28564, y: 208}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 33890208
          Name: 
          Text: "When dealer is null,\nWe will use the \"FixedAtk\" Dynamic variable
            on the <CombatDamage> inspector \nto set the attack power value."
          Position: {x: -2882.8572, y: 71.42857}
          Size: {x: 381.14282, y: 171.42856}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 71650702
          Name: 
          Text: "When dealer is null,\nWe will use the \"FixedCrit\" Dynamic variable
            on the <CombatDamage> inspector \nto set the critical chance value."
          Position: {x: -3501.7144, y: 784.5714}
          Size: {x: 373.14282, y: 172}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 246978
          Name: Damage formulas
          Text: 'We used basic damage formulas:

            Dmg = (100 * Atk)/(Def
            + 100) so attacks always do at least some damage.'
          Position: {x: -1548.5714, y: -216}
          Size: {x: 645.7143, y: 156}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 87016488
          Name: 
          Text: If the target is invincible, The damage will be 0.
          Position: {x: -2153.7144, y: 697.1429}
          Size: {x: 300.00012, y: 100}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 59062753
          Name: 
          Text: Randomly instant kill target base on Dealer's 'death' rate.
          Position: {x: -1509.7142, y: 128.57143}
          Size: {x: 344.5714, y: 116}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 13955411
          Name: 
          Text: Only apply damage when the final damage value is greater or equal
            than 0, to avoid unexpected bug.
          Position: {x: -861.1429, y: 169.14285}
          Size: {x: 297.7143, y: 193.71428}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 24382353
          Name: 
          Text: If Dealer is not null and the Target has 'Reflect Damage' rate greater
            than 0, then reflect the final damage to the Dealer based on the 'Reflect
            Damage' rate.
          Position: {x: 1387.4286, y: -1100.5715}
          Size: {x: 542.8572, y: 185.14288}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 35373417
          Name: Reduce HP
          Text: Reduce the Target's HP based on the final damage value.
          Position: {x: 1662.2858, y: 344}
          Size: {x: 300.5714, y: 210.85718}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 85634938
          Name: 
          Text: 'If the target is blocking,

            Compare the angle between
            its forward direction and the vector between the Dealer and Target with
            the ''block'' attribute(Degrees).'
          Position: {x: -2155.4285, y: 1201.1428}
          Size: {x: 312.5713, y: 262.85718}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 159811
          Name: Final Damage
          Text: 
          Position: {x: -1188, y: 1529.1428}
          Size: {x: 281.7143, y: 100}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 31387483
          Name: Send Message
          Text: "Send \"Damage\" Message with the final damage value first, \nThen
            send 'Hit' Message with the transform of the <CombatDamage> component
            as arg."
          Position: {x: 406.85715, y: 461.14285}
          Size: {x: 323.99997, y: 307.42856}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 3288832
          Name: Over Time Effect <Target>
          Text: If you set Dynamic Variable 'TargetOTE' on <CombatDamage> to any
            index number of an effect (other than -1), this over time effect will
            be add to the Target upon hit.
          Position: {x: 1002.8571, y: 912}
          Size: {x: 549.1429, y: 274.85712}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 13413667
          Name: Over Time Effect <Dealer>
          Text: If you set Dynamic Variable 'DealerOTE' on <CombatDamage> to any
            index number of an effect (other than -1), this over time effect will
            be add to the Dealer upon hit.
          Position: {x: 1007.4286, y: 1336}
          Size: {x: 550.28564, y: 314.28564}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 67464473
          Name: Stun
          Text: Randomly stun the Target based on the stun chance of the damage Dealer.
          Position: {x: 1281.1428, y: 1824.5714}
          Size: {x: 311.4286, y: 256.5713}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 5541127
          Name: Reduce Shield
          Text: Reduce the Target's Energy Shield Point when it's greater than 0,
            based on the final damage value.
          Position: {x: 1653.7142, y: -64.57143}
          Size: {x: 310.85718, y: 237.7143}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 3505234
          Name: Health Steal
          Text: Add health point for damage Dealer based on its hp steal attribute
            and the final damage.
          Position: {x: 1008, y: 2339.4287}
          Size: {x: 380, y: 234.28564}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 33241364
          Name: Shield Block
          Text: Send message to the Target if it block the attack with shield, so
            it can play associated animation and sound.
          Position: {x: 1023.4286, y: 2925.7144}
          Size: {x: 396, y: 288}
          FontSize: 1
          Theme: 0
        - Uid: 6835261
          Name: 
